{% import "icon.njk" as ic %}
<section class="hero water-hero water-hero--join"><img class="water-hero__image" src="/assets/photo-hero-2.jpg" alt="The Yarra River Dragons paddling together" fetchpriority="high"><div class="container water-hero__content"><h1>Your first paddle starts here.</h1><p>Not a paddler yet? Perfect. Your first month with Yarra River Dragons is free.</p><div class="hero__ctas"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="#register">Get your free Dragon Pass</a></div></div></section>
<section class="section water-session"><div class="container water-session__inner">{% set next = schedule.sessions[0] %}<div><h2>{% if schedule.source == "teamapp-build-sync" %}{% if next.cancelled %}Session cancelled{% else %}{{ next.day }} at {{ next.time }}{% endif %}{% else %}Check the next session on TeamApp{% endif %}</h2><p>{% if schedule.source == "teamapp-build-sync" %}Check TeamApp for changes before travelling. {% else %}The next training date is not verified in this preview. {% endif %}Contact the crew to confirm your first-session induction time.</p></div><div><strong>Community Boating Hub</strong><p>912 Collins Street, Docklands</p><a href="{{ site.mapsUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get directions</a></div><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.teamAppUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open TeamApp</a></div></section>
<section class="section water-steps"><div class="container"><h2>Here's what happens<span class="water-accent-period">.</span></h2><ol class="first-session"><li class="first-session__step"><h3>Get your Dragon Pass</h3><p>Register online before attending. It's free for your first month.</p></li><li class="first-session__step"><h3>Meet the crew</h3><p>Arrive by 8:00 am. Let the crew know it's your first session.</p></li><li class="first-session__step"><h3>We sort the gear</h3><p>We supply the boat, paddles and personal flotation devices (life jackets).</p></li><li class="first-session__step"><h3>Paddle together</h3><p>Follow the rhythm, learn the basics and see how it feels.</p></li></ol><p>Our coaches will guide you. <a href="/about/#coaches">Meet our coaches</a>.</p></div></section>
<section class="section water-register" id="register"><div class="container water-register__grid"><div><h2>Ready to give it a go?</h2><p>The official Dragon Pass registration opens on Revolutionise. Registration must be completed there before you attend.</p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="{{ site.dragonPassUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register for your free month</a></div><div><h3>What to bring</h3><p>Comfortable clothes and shoes that can get wet, a water bottle, towel and sun protection.</p><h3>Facilities</h3><p>Toilets, change rooms, showers and lockers/storage are available.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section water-faq"><div class="container"><h2>Questions before you come?</h2><div class="water-faq__list"><details><summary>Can I come alone?</summary><p>Absolutely. You don't need to bring anyone with you.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need experience?</summary><p>No. We teach beginners from scratch.</p></details><details><summary>What if I can't swim?</summary><p>Please contact the crew beforehand so you can discuss water safety and whether the session is suitable. We provide flotation devices.</p></details><details><summary>Health &amp; accessibility</summary><p>Talk to your health professional if relevant and tell us about adjustments or support you may need.</p></details><details><summary>Weather &amp; cancellations</summary><p>Check TeamApp or YRD Facebook for cancellation updates before heading out.</p></details></div><p>Prefer a conversation? <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">Email the crew</a>.</p><div class="water-map"><iframe title="Map of Community Boating Hub, Docklands" src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=Community%20Boating%20Hub%2C%20912%20Collins%20Street%2C%20Docklands&output=embed" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div></section>